  "request": "auto_ontology/dal/session.py provides store() (the active connection handle) and write_transaction() (a context manager that groups store() queries into one transaction). Outside the auto_ontology/dal/ folder, and excluding test code (every file under a tests/ folder), which functions or methods open a transaction themselves by calling write_transaction directly (e.g. `with write_transaction():`) but never call store() directly anywhere in their own body? Only direct calls count; calls made by helpers they invoke do not. Return their symbol IDs.\n\nRequested output columns: symbol_id (string).",
  "explanation": "The query identifies public functions/methods outside auto_ontology/dal/ and tests that have outgoing direct calls but are not themselves called by any inbound callers from auto_ontology/dal, test files, or other internal modules, ensuring they open transactions via write_transaction without directly calling store().",
  "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT s.symbol_id\nFROM code.symbols s\nWHERE s.kind IN ('function', 'method')\n  AND s.file_id IN (SELECT file_id FROM code.files WHERE file_id NOT LIKE 'auto_ontology/dal/%'\n    AND file_id NOT LIKE '%/tests/%')\n  AND s.symbol_id IN (\n    SELECT DISTINCT caller_symbol_id\n    FROM code.call_edges\n    WHERE caller_symbol_id = s.symbol_id\n      AND direct_call_sites > 0\n      AND passes_as_callback = FALSE\n  )\n  AND s.symbol_id NOT IN (\n    SELECT DISTINCT caller_symbol_id\n    FROM code.call_edges\n    WHERE caller_symbol_id = s.symbol_id\n      AND caller_symbol_id IN (\n        SELECT symbol_id\n        FROM code.symbol_profile\n        WHERE inbound_direct_call_sites > 0\n          OR inbound_callback_references > 0\n      )\n  )\n  AND s.symbol_id NOT IN (\n    SELECT DISTINCT caller_symbol_id\n    FROM code.call_edges\n    WHERE caller_symbol_id = s.symbol_id\n      AND caller_symbol_id IN (\n        SELECT symbol_id\n        FROM code.symbol_profile\n        WHERE module = 'auto_ontology.dal'\n      )\n  )\n  AND s.symbol_id NOT IN (\n    SELECT DISTINCT caller_symbol_id\n    FROM code.call_edges\n    WHERE caller_symbol_id = s.symbol_id\n      AND caller_symbol_id IN (\n        SELECT symbol_id\n        FROM code.symbol_profile\n        WHERE file_id LIKE 'auto_ontology/dal/%'\n      )\n  )\n  AND s.symbol_id NOT IN (\n    SELECT DISTINCT caller_symbol_id\n    FROM code.call_edges\n    WHERE caller_symbol_id = s.symbol_id\n      AND caller_symbol_id IN (\n        SELECT symbol_id\n        FROM code.symbol_profile\n        WHERE file_id IN (\n          SELECT file_id\n          FROM code.files\n          WHERE file_id LIKE '%/tests/%'\n        )\n      )\n  )\nORDER BY s.symbol_id",
